# UI / UX skills

Full map: **[docs/ui-ux-skills.md](../docs/ui-ux-skills.md)**

## Before any UI code

Read **`.agents/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md`** and **`.agents/skills/coss/SKILL.md`**. Use **`@loftlancer/ui`** — no duplicate primitives.

## Also read by task

| Task | Skills |
|------|--------|
| New screen / form / dialog | **coss-particles**, **ui-ux-pro-max**, docs **rendering**, **app-states**, **data-workflow** |
| Complex component API | **vercel-composition-patterns** |
| Motion / polish | **emil-design-eng** |
| Operate polish / redesign | **impeccable** (Studio/Auth = Operate mode) |
| Marketing / distinctive landing | **frontend-design** (+ **impeccable** Persuade) |
| UI audit | **web-design-guidelines**, **ui-ux-pro-max** |
| Radix → Base migration | **migrate-radix-to-base** |
| Perf | **vercel-react-best-practices** |

## Product contract

ServiceResponse boundaries, toasts, route skeletons — **docs**, not optional. Skills do not override **failed** vs **error** vs empty.
